<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7295] Log of thin client is not disabled in special case</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7295</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Should be possibility to enable/disable thin client log.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We try to disable thin client log in GridClientImpl.java. &lt;br/&gt;
If log4j is located in a classpath log will be showed (f.e. when thin client is run from Windows console) &lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13127066">IGNITE-7295</key>
            <summary>Log of thin client is not disabled in special case</summary>
