                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16303043" author="vsisko" created="Mon, 25 Dec 2017 03:40:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed disabling of log in thin client.&lt;br/&gt;
Added IGNITE_GRID_CLIENT_LOG_ENABLED environment variable to enable log of thin client.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16319883" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 10 Jan 2018 08:23:21 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Tested. Client output printed out only if IGNITE_GRID_CLIENT_LOG_ENABLED = true&lt;br/&gt;
To test run snapshot utility and try to execute any command (f.e. list)&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16323528" author="kuaw26" created="Fri, 12 Jan 2018 04:26:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good. Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16343052" author="pkonstantinov" created="Mon, 29 Jan 2018 08:19:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Tested&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
